Dialogue: 0,0:02:03.18,0:02:04.29,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,来得正好\N{\fnArial\fs30}Right on time.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:04.29,0:02:07.05,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,- 你好啊  卡尔  - 你好  这是黛西\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Hey, Karl. - Hey, what up, girl? This is Daisy.
