Dialogue: 0,0:08:42.33,0:08:44.25,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,- 抱歉  - 天啊\N{\fnArial\fs30}- I'm so sorry. - Oh, God.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:45.34,0:08:47.22,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,好了  去玩吧  不许打架\N{\fnArial\fs30}OK, go play, no fighting.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:49.37,0:08:52.03,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,该死  别啊\N{\fnArial\fs30}Goddamn it. Come on.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:55.96,0:08:58.72,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,没什么比自家做的菜更好了\N{\fnArial\fs30}Can't beat a little home cooking.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:01.54,0:09:03.59,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,- 哥们  - 你好吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Hey, man. - What's going on?
Dialogue: 0,0:09:04.77,0:09:05.78,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,还改握手了\N{\fnArial\fs30}Handshake?
Dialogue: 0,0:09:06.19,0:09:08.92,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,怕我传染你还是怎么着\N{\fnArial\fs30}What am I, like, infected or something?
Dialogue: 0,0:09:08.92,0:09:09.90,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,去你的\N{\fnArial\fs30}Fuck you.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:10.52,0:09:12.52,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,快过来  抱一个\N{\fnArial\fs30}Come on, get in here, man.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:13.14,0:09:15.79,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,这样才像话嘛  放开点  别拘谨\N{\fnArial\fs30}Ah, that's better, let it out, buddy, let it out.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:16.54,0:09:17.98,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,你还是个混蛋啊\N{\fnArial\fs30}You're still an asshole, I see.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:17.98,0:09:19.48,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,生日快乐\N{\fnArial\fs30}Happy birthday.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:20.15,0:09:21.85,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,你还开始用礼品包装袋了\N{\fnArial\fs30}When did you start using gift bags?
Dialogue: 0,0:09:21.85,0:09:23.37,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,是商店送的\N{\fnArial\fs30}The store did that.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:23.37,0:09:24.43,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,要打开看看吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}You gonna open it?
Dialogue: 0,0:09:29.73,0:09:31.73,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,, 《生死搏击》\N{\fnArial\fs30}Striking Vipers.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:31.73,0:09:34.96,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,X  《生死搏击X》\N{\fnArial\fs30}X. Striking Vipers X.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:34.96,0:09:37.34,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,最新的一版  昨天才发售\N{\fnArial\fs30}Newest instalment. Came out just yesterday.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:37.39,0:09:38.47,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我刚好在商店\N{\fnArial\fs30}I was in the store,
Dialogue: 0,0:09:38.73,0:09:39.83,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,看到了就...\N{\fnArial\fs30}I saw it and...
Dialogue: 0,0:09:39.83,0:09:41.31,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,天啊\N{\fnArial\fs30}Oh, man.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:42.57,0:09:44.03,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,想当年啊\N{\fnArial\fs30}This takes me back.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:45.01,0:09:47.16,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,这里写  需要虚拟现实拓展组件\N{\fnArial\fs30}It says here you need one of those VR add-ons.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:47.17,0:09:48.79,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我没有那东西\N{\fnArial\fs30}I don't have one of those.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:50.04,0:09:51.04,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,你有啊\N{\fnArial\fs30}Yes, you do.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:55.39,0:09:56.34,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,不会吧\N{\fnArial\fs30}No.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:00.30,0:10:03.49,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,不是吧  不行  伙计\N{\fnArial\fs30}No. No, come on, man.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:03.49,0:10:07.37,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,不  今天是你生日  快收下  好吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}No. It's your birthday, just take the damn thing, would you?
Dialogue: 0,0:10:07.38,0:10:11.36,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,真的  绝对让你爽翻天  我在店里试了\N{\fnArial\fs30}Seriously, you gonna flip the fuck out. I tried it out in the store.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:11.36,0:10:13.81,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,他们让我看了五分钟小样\N{\fnArial\fs30}They demoed it for me. Five minutes
Dialogue: 0,0:10:13.81,0:10:17.12,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我脑子都炸开花了\N{\fnArial\fs30}blew my mind to confetti.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:18.96,0:10:20.69,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,- 谢了  伙计  - 不客气\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Thanks, man. - It's all good.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:22.97,0:10:23.98,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,那是你儿子吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}That your one?
Dialogue: 0,0:10:25.74,0:10:26.88,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,不  那是麦克斯韦尔\N{\fnArial\fs30}No, that's Maxwell.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:26.88,0:10:28.78,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,麦克斯韦尔  伙计们\N{\fnArial\fs30}Maxwell. Guys, guys.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:28.78,0:10:31.83,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,泰勒在学校的小伙伴\N{\fnArial\fs30}Tyler's friend from school.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:34.22,0:10:35.48,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,要来瓶啤酒吗  伙计\N{\fnArial\fs30}You want a beer, man?
Dialogue: 0,0:10:35.86,0:10:38.86,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,他终于拯救了我  太好了\N{\fnArial\fs30}Finally he saves me. Yes.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:41.89,0:10:42.95,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,谢了\N{\fnArial\fs30}Thank you.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:43.96,0:10:47.52,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,妈妈  我一直在跟凯蒂玩\N{\fnArial\fs30}Mommy, Mommy, Mommy, I've been playing with Katie.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:48.04,0:10:51.20,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,西奥  我们要用塑料杯子吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}Theo, are we using the plastic cups?
Dialogue: 0,0:10:51.20,0:10:52.58,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,西奥看起来不错\N{\fnArial\fs30}Theo's looking good.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:54.80,0:10:57.16,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,很高兴看到你俩至少还有一人在健身\N{\fnArial\fs30}Good to see at least one of you still has a gym membership.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:57.17,0:10:58.24,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,是吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}Oh, really?
Dialogue: 0,0:10:58.35,0:10:59.93,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,说真的  伙计\N{\fnArial\fs30}Seriously, man.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:00.71,0:11:03.31,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,你现在走路就像个科学怪人似的\N{\fnArial\fs30}You're walking around like a fucking Frankenstein movie.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:03.31,0:11:06.79,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我膝盖坏掉后  一直没法健身  好吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}Look, since my knee went, I haven't been able to work out, all right?
Dialogue: 0,0:11:06.79,0:11:08.63,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我不是想找借口  我只是...\N{\fnArial\fs30}I'm not using that as an excuse. I'm just...
Dialogue: 0,0:11:08.63,0:11:10.66,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,不  当然不是\N{\fnArial\fs30}No, no, no, of course not.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:10.85,0:11:12.23,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,去你的  好吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}Fuck you, all right?
Dialogue: 0,0:11:12.53,0:11:15.57,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我能顺其自然了  我已经有妻有子了\N{\fnArial\fs30}I can afford to let things slide. I'm settled.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:15.57,0:11:18.66,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,感谢上帝我不用再出去约会\N{\fnArial\fs30}I thank God I don't have to be out there on the dating scene.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:18.66,0:11:22.03,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,随时等着被人挑什么的\N{\fnArial\fs30}Always on sale. Fucking bullshit.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:22.03,0:11:23.29,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,那就像是第二份工作\N{\fnArial\fs30}It is like a second job.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:23.30,0:11:25.00,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,还得跟紧那些年轻人的节奏\N{\fnArial\fs30}Gotta keep up with those younger dudes.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:25.00,0:11:26.85,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,你每天得做一千个仰卧起坐吧\N{\fnArial\fs30}You gotta do a thousand crunches a day?
Dialogue: 0,0:11:26.85,0:11:28.41,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,就每天早上做50个\N{\fnArial\fs30}Only 50 each morning.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:29.41,0:11:30.61,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,早上50个\N{\fnArial\fs30}Fifty in the morning?
Dialogue: 0,0:11:31.51,0:11:33.05,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,你会刮蛋上的毛吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}You wax your ballsack?
Dialogue: 0,0:11:33.68,0:11:35.88,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,那些年轻人肯定会\N{\fnArial\fs30}I'm sure as shit those young dudes do.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:37.12,0:11:39.80,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,你还真刮...太恶心了\N{\fnArial\fs30}You wax your ball... You nasty.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:40.07,0:11:42.43,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,刮得像个闪闪发光的八号球\N{\fnArial\fs30}Till it's gleaming like an eight ball.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:43.95,0:11:46.22,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,就为了保持撩妹的竞争力\N{\fnArial\fs30}Just to stay in the game.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:47.42,0:11:49.79,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,- 我真是同情你  - 嗯  好吧\N{\fnArial\fs30}- I pity you, really. - Yeah. Well...
Dialogue: 0,0:11:53.14,0:11:55.12,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,想知道我离开这里之后会去哪吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}You wanna know where I'm going after I leave here?
Dialogue: 0,0:11:55.28,0:11:57.47,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,去刮屄和屁眼之间的毛吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}Shit, getting your taint waxed too?
Dialogue: 0,0:11:58.72,0:12:02.49,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,去见玛丽耶拉\N{\fnArial\fs30}Meeting Mariella.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:02.88,0:12:04.05,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,玛丽耶拉\N{\fnArial\fs30}Mariella.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:04.06,0:12:06.01,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,她是做伴唱的\N{\fnArial\fs30}She does backing vocals.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:06.01,0:12:07.18,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,给谁伴唱  学校乐团吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}What, for the school band?
Dialogue: 0,0:12:07.18,0:12:08.50,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,她多大了\N{\fnArial\fs30}How old is she?
Dialogue: 0,0:12:08.87,0:12:09.85,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,29\N{\fnArial\fs30}Twenty-nine.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:12.31,0:12:15.26,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,不  28  看  这还是她\N{\fnArial\fs30}No, 28. See. Here she is again.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:15.26,0:12:16.17,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,对\N{\fnArial\fs30}Yeah.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:18.86,0:12:20.60,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,要给全班同学看看吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}You wanna share that with the class?
Dialogue: 0,0:12:28.58,0:12:30.93,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,- 真是个幸运的男人  - 没错\N{\fnArial\fs30}- You lucky man. - I am, me.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:37.53,0:12:38.68,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,你那是干什么\N{\fnArial\fs30}What are you doing?
Dialogue: 0,0:12:39.55,0:12:40.59,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,你搞什么\N{\fnArial\fs30}What are you doing?
Dialogue: 0,0:12:50.08,0:12:51.29,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,泰勒睡了吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}Tyler asleep?
Dialogue: 0,0:12:51.97,0:12:54.99,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我又读了一遍那本马卡鲁的破书\N{\fnArial\fs30}Had to read that damn Macaroo book again
Dialogue: 0,0:12:54.99,0:12:57.07,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,他才让我熄了灯\N{\fnArial\fs30}before he'd let me put out the light.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:58.49,0:13:00.00,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,"马卡鲁发现了一只鞋..."\N{\fnArial\fs30}"Macaroo found a shoe..."
Dialogue: 0,0:13:00.00,0:13:01.83,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,"把它放进了一棵树里"\N{\fnArial\fs30}"And put it in a tree."
Dialogue: 0,0:13:02.09,0:13:04.47,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,马卡鲁一点都不尊重环境\N{\fnArial\fs30}Macaroo's got no respect for his environment,
Dialogue: 0,0:13:04.47,0:13:06.04,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我就这么一说\N{\fnArial\fs30}that's all I'm saying.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:07.09,0:13:09.60,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,- 我来吧  - 没事的\N{\fnArial\fs30}- I can do that. - No, I'm fine.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:11.09,0:13:12.63,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,今天是你生日  来吧\N{\fnArial\fs30}It's your birthday, come on.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:18.09,0:13:18.99,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,谢谢\N{\fnArial\fs30}Thank you.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:20.86,0:13:21.97,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,好了\N{\fnArial\fs30}Ok.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:24.57,0:13:28.86,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,对了  你该告诉我卡尔和黛西分手了\N{\fnArial\fs30}You know, you should've told me that Karl and Daisy broke up.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:29.67,0:13:32.36,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,- 他有说是谁提出来的吗  - 我没问\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Did he say who broke up with who? - I didn't ask.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:33.27,0:13:36.74,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我总说那俩人不会有什么好结果\N{\fnArial\fs30}I always said that those two were not good news together.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:38.02,0:13:40.24,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我好久没见着他了\N{\fnArial\fs30}So long since I saw him last.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:40.24,0:13:42.27,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,上次见面还是去年生日吧\N{\fnArial\fs30}Had to be last year's birthday, I think.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:42.27,0:13:44.08,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,有一整年没见了吧\N{\fnArial\fs30}In the flesh, a whole year?
Dialogue: 0,0:13:45.53,0:13:47.80,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,他和他手机上的那个妹子  是认真的吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}Him and the girl on his phone, is that serious?
Dialogue: 0,0:13:50.80,0:13:52.44,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我没问\N{\fnArial\fs30}I didn't ask.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:52.45,0:13:54.13,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,男人都不善于聊天\N{\fnArial\fs30}Guys suck at talking.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:54.52,0:13:55.81,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,你俩认识多久了\N{\fnArial\fs30}How long have you two known each other?
Dialogue: 0,0:13:55.81,0:13:59.34,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,这种场合根本没机会聊这些事  是吧\N{\fnArial\fs30}You don't actually get to talk at these things, though, do you?
Dialogue: 0,0:13:59.56,0:14:01.53,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,也就只能闲聊\N{\fnArial\fs30}I mean, beyond surface bullshit.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:01.83,0:14:05.17,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,再就是家长八卦  现在净说这个了\N{\fnArial\fs30}Or parent talk. There's a lot of that these days.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:05.17,0:14:06.56,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,你们应该多一起玩玩\N{\fnArial\fs30}Y'all should hang out more.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:06.96,0:14:10.39,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,你也知道的  工作忙\N{\fnArial\fs30}Yeah, well, you know, work.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:10.90,0:14:12.28,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我们是父母了\N{\fnArial\fs30}And we're parents.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:12.67,0:14:16.18,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,他在城里做唱片  我们住在郊区\N{\fnArial\fs30}He's downtown with the label and we're out here.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:16.45,0:14:18.04,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我们应该请他来吃晚餐\N{\fnArial\fs30}We should have him over for dinner.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:19.13,0:14:21.00,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,你可以做你拿手的辣椒\N{\fnArial\fs30}You could make your chili.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:24.38,0:14:25.33,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,好啊\N{\fnArial\fs30}Sure.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:28.99,0:14:30.82,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,危险餐具警告\N{\fnArial\fs30}Flatware hazard warning.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:30.82,0:14:33.43,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,你得把刀刃朝下\N{\fnArial\fs30}You gotta put the knives in sharp edge down.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:33.48,0:14:34.28,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我知道\N{\fnArial\fs30}I know.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:46.39,0:14:48.47,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,你看那人的罗德曼造型\N{\fnArial\fs30}Check out the Rodman look on this guy.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:49.19,0:14:50.15,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,你好吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}How are you?
Dialogue: 0,0:14:52.33,0:14:53.38,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,罗德曼\N{\fnArial\fs30}Rodman?
Dialogue: 0,0:14:53.46,0:14:54.77,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,丹尼斯·罗德曼\N{\fnArial\fs30}Dennis Rodman.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:01.84,0:15:04.59,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,- 他以前是个球员  对吗  - 对\N{\fnArial\fs30}- He used to be a ball player, right? - Right.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:05.84,0:15:06.70,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,你是说发型\N{\fnArial\fs30}The hair.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:07.92,0:15:08.74,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,明白了\N{\fnArial\fs30}Got it.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:13.79,0:15:16.44,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,手机软件上说我们需要在一小时内完成\N{\fnArial\fs30}The app says we need to do it within the hour.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:16.74,0:15:18.37,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,现在是受孕高峰期\N{\fnArial\fs30}It's peak fertility.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:20.92,0:15:23.62,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我有点累了  但我觉得我们应该试试\N{\fnArial\fs30}I'm kind of beat but I guess that we should.
