Dialogue: 0,0:54:23.78,0:54:25.54,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,所以干脆就亲一个\N{\fnArial\fs30}So let's just fucking kiss.
Dialogue: 0,0:54:26.78,0:54:27.67,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,好吧\N{\fnArial\fs30}Ok.
Dialogue: 0,0:54:32.19,0:54:33.16,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我说了好\N{\fnArial\fs30}I said OK.
Dialogue: 0,0:54:33.16,0:54:34.50,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,让我酝酿一会儿\N{\fnArial\fs30}I'm working up to it.
Dialogue: 0,0:54:37.34,0:54:39.21,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,- 要我主动吗  - 我怎么知道\N{\fnArial\fs30}- You want me to start? - I don't know.
Dialogue: 0,0:54:42.30,0:54:43.16,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,也行\N{\fnArial\fs30}Yeah.
Dialogue: 0,0:54:45.23,0:54:46.12,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,好吧\N{\fnArial\fs30}Ok.
Dialogue: 0,0:54:54.26,0:54:55.22,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,准备好了吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}You ready?
Dialogue: 0,0:54:57.45,0:54:59.44,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,赶紧亲吧  哥们\N{\fnArial\fs30}Just fucking kiss me, man.
Dialogue: 0,0:55:19.28,0:55:20.18,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,没感觉\N{\fnArial\fs30}Nope.
Dialogue: 0,0:55:21.04,0:55:22.41,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,什么都没有\N{\fnArial\fs30}Not a damn thing.
Dialogue: 0,0:55:24.41,0:55:25.55,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我也是  没感觉\N{\fnArial\fs30}No, me neither.
Dialogue: 0,0:55:30.48,0:55:31.74,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,看来说清楚了\N{\fnArial\fs30}So that settles it.
Dialogue: 0,0:55:43.30,0:55:44.80,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,你知道在游戏里是不一样的\N{\fnArial\fs30}You know it's different in the game.
Dialogue: 0,0:55:44.80,0:55:45.72,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,不行\N{\fnArial\fs30}No.
Dialogue: 0,0:55:46.24,0:55:47.43,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,你得忘记这些愚蠢的想法\N{\fnArial\fs30}You got to get that shit out of your head.
Dialogue: 0,0:55:47.43,0:55:48.94,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,- 忘不掉了  哥们  - 不行\N{\fnArial\fs30}- It ain't coming out, man. - No.
Dialogue: 0,0:55:48.94,0:55:50.42,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,- 已经深埋在脑子里了  - 去你妈的\N{\fnArial\fs30}- It's burrowed right in there. - No, fuck you.
Dialogue: 0,0:55:50.42,0:55:52.25,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,就在这里  哥们\N{\fnArial\fs30}Burrowed right in there, man.
Dialogue: 0,0:55:52.25,0:55:54.01,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我知道  你也知道\N{\fnArial\fs30}I know it, you know it.
Dialogue: 0,0:55:54.95,0:55:56.47,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,埋在你的脑子里了  是吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}It's buried in there, huh?
Dialogue: 0,0:55:56.96,0:55:59.09,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,- 或许打你一顿你就忘了  - 别推我\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Maybe we can get rid of it like that. - Don't push me, man.
Dialogue: 0,0:55:59.09,0:56:01.32,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,- 你是大男人吗  推你怎么着  - 别推我\N{\fnArial\fs30}- You a big man? What you gonna do? - Don't push me.
Dialogue: 0,0:56:01.32,0:56:02.70,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,就推你了怎么着\N{\fnArial\fs30}What you gonna do?
Dialogue: 0,0:56:05.45,0:56:06.47,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,好吧\N{\fnArial\fs30}Ok.
Dialogue: 0,0:56:08.95,0:56:09.86,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,停\N{\fnArial\fs30}Stop.
Dialogue: 0,0:56:13.83,0:56:16.64,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,别打了  别打了\N{\fnArial\fs30}Stop! Stop!
Dialogue: 0,0:56:33.98,0:56:35.27,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我丈夫在这\N{\fnArial\fs30}My husband's here.
Dialogue: 0,0:56:35.41,0:56:39.98,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,- 他叫丹尼  丹尼尔·帕克  - 丹尼尔·帕克\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Danny, Daniel Parker. - Daniel Parker.
Dialogue: 0,0:56:55.37,0:56:57.58,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我知道你们两个晚餐时在吵架\N{\fnArial\fs30}I knew y'all were mad at each other over dinner.
Dialogue: 0,0:57:02.14,0:57:03.97,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,你们到底在吵什么\N{\fnArial\fs30}So, what were you fighting about?
Dialogue: 0,0:57:12.97,0:57:13.96,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,听见了吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}Hello?
Dialogue: 0,0:57:17.53,0:57:18.91,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,妈了个逼的\N{\fnArial\fs30}Holy fuck!
Dialogue: 0,0:57:20.20,0:57:21.52,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,跟我说话啊\N{\fnArial\fs30}Talk to me.
Dialogue: 0,0:57:39.39,0:57:41.19,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,你们把孩子带进来\N{\fnArial\fs30}You guys, bring the kids in.
Dialogue: 0,0:57:46.69,0:57:48.15,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,你们真会生孩子\N{\fnArial\fs30}You guys make great babies.
Dialogue: 0,0:57:48.20,0:57:50.58,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,- 我家孩子丑得啊  - 什么\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Ours look like a mile of bad road. - What?
Dialogue: 0,0:57:50.58,0:57:52.20,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我要是个保姆就好了\N{\fnArial\fs30}I wish I was a baby-sitter.
Dialogue: 0,0:58:21.46,0:58:22.94,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,生日快乐\N{\fnArial\fs30}Happy birthday.
Dialogue: 0,0:58:32.57,0:58:34.01,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,明天早上还我\N{\fnArial\fs30}I want that back in the morning.
Dialogue: 0,0:58:35.34,0:58:36.27,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,你也是\N{\fnArial\fs30}Ditto.
Dialogue: 0,0:59:36.50,0:59:38.85,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,- 准备好了吗  - 我准备好了\N{\fnArial\fs30}- You ready? - I'm ready.
